      <h2>Application</h2>

      <h4>Data Structures & Algorithms</h4>
      <p>
        Mastering common algorithms and data structures is one of the most empowering aspects of a
        computer science education. It directly enhances problem-solving skills, and the concepts you
        learn will naturally extend to building real-world applications. For this, I have to go back
        to my Berkeley roots with
        <a href="https://sp19.datastructur.es/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CS 61B</a>, taught by
        one of my favorite professors, Josh Hug.
      </p>

      <h4>ML Engineering</h4>
